OL,3,GNEWSAThousands to watch Blackpool
OL,4,AIlluminations launch
OL,5,
OL,6,FThousands of people will gather later
OL,7,Fto watch the Blackpool Illuminations
OL,8,Fbeing turned on.
OL,10,FBBC Radio 2 presenter and Phoenix
OL,11,FNights star Paddy McGuinness will flick
OL,12,Fthe switch to mark the official start
OL,13,Fof this year's spectacular light show.
OL,15,FThe free event at the Tower Festival
OL,16,FHeadland will be hosted by BBC Radio
OL,17,FLancashire's Graham Liver and Sharon
OL,18,FHartley.
OL,20,FThe illuminations will run for six
OL,21,Fmiles (10km) along the promenade and
OL,22,Fcan be seen until Sunday 3 January.
OL,23,APub: 16-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
